Fibonacci Taquitos.

Ingredients.
0 g tortillas
1 g chicken
0 g cheese
0 g beans

Method.
Take beans from refrigerator.
Simmer the beans.
Put chicken into the mixing bowl.
Fold cheese into the mixing bowl.
Put tortillas into the mixing bowl.
Add chicken to the mixing bowl.
Fold chicken into the mixing bowl.
Put cheese into the mixing bowl.
Fold tortillas into the mixing bowl.
Cook the beans until simmered.
Put tortillas into the mixing bowl.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.

Serves 1.

